{"availability":"available","full":"JerenzeLevi/impromptu-speech-padula","name":"impromptu-speech-padula","description":" Harry Potter–themed live reveal system for Impromptu Speech (Padula), Literary Night 2026.","category":"Developer tools","language":"JavaScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-02T13:42:11Z","updated":"2026-10-04T14:42:10Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://impromptu-speech-padula.vercel.app","topics":["event-system","harry-potter","impromptu-speech","literary-night","vanilla-javascript","vercel"],"demo":"https://impromptu-speech-padula.vercel.app/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T18:21:27.166Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T18:21:27.166Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T18:21:27.166Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T15:46:24.167Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-08T18:21:27.166Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Live reveal system for the Impromptu Speech category (Padula) at Literary Night 2026.","The board shows ten enchanted Harry Potter-themed relics, \"Choose Your Fate\". Each relic can be touched once, and it unveils its own hidden image full screen. The pictures are kept secret until the event: they are uploaded by the operator on the day, so nobody (including the site builder) sees them beforehand.","The PIN is hard-coded statically in app.js on purpose. The only thing being hidden is a set of event pictures until the reveal, so there is no sensitive data, no personal information (SPI/PII) and no accounts involved. The PIN is just a casual \"not before the event\" gate for the operator, not real security, so a backend or proper authentication would be unnecessary here. The hidden images themselves are never stored in the repo."],"features":["10 relic containers in a 5x2 grid, sized for a projector / LED wall. Each shows an animated video or a gently moving image.","One touch each. Once opened, a container is disabled and marked \"Revealed\". This persists across refreshes.","PIN-gated upload. The \"Upload\" button (bottom-left) asks for a PIN, then opens an upload panel (see How the upload works).","Pick 10 or more images. The first 10 different images are used.","1:1 assignment: image 1 goes to container 1, image 2 to container 2, and so on. Duplicate files (compared by content, not filename) are rejected, so an image never appears in two containers."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/JerenzeLevi/impromptu-speech-padula/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"6dcf163b51f257dfdba89c7fa83740cabafe2597876426146af155149f793137","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T15:46:24.261Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T15:46:24.261Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Live reveal system for the Impromptu Speech category (Padula) at Literary Night 2026.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/JerenzeLevi/impromptu-speech-padula/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"documented","text":"The only thing being hidden is a set of event pictures until the reveal, so there is no sensitive data, no personal information (SPI/PII) and no accounts involved.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/JerenzeLevi/impromptu-speech-padula/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"6dcf163b51f257dfdba89c7fa83740cabafe2597876426146af155149f793137","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/JerenzeLevi/impromptu-speech-padula/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T15:46:24.261Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-04T14:42:10Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/JerenzeLevi/impromptu-speech-padula/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T15:46:24.261Z","hash":"6dcf163b51f257dfdba89c7fa83740cabafe2597876426146af155149f793137","originalBytes":4696,"storedBytes":4696,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["images","container","upload","image","pin","never","uploaded","browser","files","live","site","slot","ai-generated","assets","clicking","each","event","event.","h